description:
**File:** home/bcotton.nix

**Issue:** Lines 11-14 use fetchTarball with hardcoded URL and sha256:
```nix
nixVsCodeServer = fetchTarball {
  url = "https://github.com/zeyugao/nixos-vscode-server/tarball/master";
  sha256 = "sha256:1l77kybmghws3y834b1agb69vs6h4l746ga5xccvz4p1y8wc67h7";
};
```

**Fix:** Move to flake.nix inputs for:
- Consistent version pinning with flake.lock
- Automatic updates with `nix flake update`
- Better reproducibility

**File:** home/bcotton.nix

