```nix
matchBlocks = {
};
```

**Fix:** Remove the empty block entirely. It serves no purpose.

design:
Current hardcoded values found:
- bobs-laptop: InitialKeyRepeat=25, KeyRepeat=4, enableKeyMapping=true, remapCapsLockToEscape=false
- bobs-imac: InitialKeyRepeat=25, KeyRepeat=4, enableKeyMapping=true, remapCapsLockToEscape=false  
- toms-darwin: InitialKeyRepeat=25, KeyRepeat=4, enableKeyMapping=false, remapCapsLockToEscape=false

Approach:
1. Add to hosts/common/variables.nix:
   keyboard = {
     initialKeyRepeat = 25;
     keyRepeat = 4;
     enableKeyMapping = false;
     remapCapsLockToEscape = false;
   };
2. Update Darwin common or per-host configs to use variables.keyboard.*
3. Allow per-host overrides for enableKeyMapping (varies by host)

description:
Refactor agenix secrets management following the pattern from notthebee/nix-config: create a separate private git repository for secrets and import it as a flake input with 'flake = false'. This improves security by keeping secrets separate from the public config repo.

Reference: https://git.notthebe.ee/notthebee/nix-config/src/branch/main/flake.nix

Pattern:
  secrets = {
    url = "git+ssh://...";
    flake = false;
  };

notes:
IMPLEMENTATION:

home/modules/clipboard-receiver.nix (macOS):
```nix
{ config, lib, pkgs, ... }:
with lib;
let cfg = config.programs.clipboard-receiver;
in {
  options.programs.clipboard-receiver = {
    enable = mkEnableOption "clipboard-receiver daemon";
    port = mkOption {
      type = types.port;
      default = 7891;
      description = "Port to listen on";
    };
  };
  config = mkIf (cfg.enable && pkgs.stdenv.isDarwin) {
    home.packages = [ pkgs.localPackages.clipboard-receiver ];
  };
}
```

home/modules/remote-copy.nix (Linux):
```nix
{ config, lib, pkgs, ... }:
with lib;
let cfg = config.programs.remote-copy;
in {
  options.programs.remote-copy = {
    enable = mkEnableOption "remote-copy clipboard client";
    port = mkOption { type = types.port; default = 7891; };
  };
  config = mkIf (cfg.enable && pkgs.stdenv.isLinux) {
    home.packages = [ pkgs.localPackages.remote-copy ];
    home.sessionVariables.REMOTE_CLIPBOARD_PORT = toString cfg.port;
  };
}
```

Pattern reference: home/modules/browser-opener.nix, home/modules/xdg-open-remote.nix

IMPLEMENTATION:

Add to hosts/common/darwin-common.nix launchd.user.agents:
```nix
clipboard-receiver = lib.mkIf (builtins.any (user: user.programs.clipboard-receiver.enable or false) (builtins.attrValues config.home-manager.users)) {
  ProgramArguments = ["${localPackages.clipboard-receiver}/bin/clipboard-receiver"];
  KeepAlive = true;
  RunAtLoad = true;
  ThrottleInterval = 10;
  StandardOutPath = "/tmp/clipboard-receiver.log";
  StandardErrorPath = "/tmp/clipboard-receiver.error.log";
};
```

